flowchart LR
    Upload[Source PDF / DOCX] --> Parse[Parser]
    Parse --> Review{Extraction reviewed?}
    Review -- No --> UserReview[User review]
    UserReview --> Canonical[Canonical Resume JSON]
    Review -- Yes --> Canonical

    Canonical --> Optimize[Resume Optimizer]
    Job[Job Snapshot] --> Optimize
    Optimize --> Proposal[Tailored Resume JSON]
    Proposal --> Approval{User approval required?}
    Approval -- Yes --> Approve[Approve content]
    Approval -- No --> Template
    Approve --> Template[Versioned template]

    Template --> Latex[LaTeX renderer]
    Template --> Docx[DOCX renderer]
    Template --> Html[HTML renderer]
    Latex --> Pdf[Text-selectable PDF]
    Docx --> DocxOut[Editable DOCX]
    Html --> HtmlOut[HTML / PDF preview]
    Pdf --> Validate[Render and ATS validation]
    DocxOut --> Validate
    HtmlOut --> Validate
    Validate --> Artifact[Immutable render artifact]
